Key: Enter
Either.Left("error message")
Either.Right(42)
Got left: error message
Got right: 42
Outcome.Success(100)
Outcome.Failure("failed")
ok is Success (wildcard)
Maybe.Just("hello")
Maybe.Nothing
Action.Raise("raising")
Action.Catch("catching")
Action.Write("writing")
Action.Read("reading")
Action.Raise: raising
Action.Catch: catching
Action.Write: writing
